# CombatMode Release Flow

Apply only when asked to prepare a release, ship an update, or finalize a version.

- Canonical procedure: `RELEASE.md`. Smoke/regression: `TESTING.md`.
- Verify WoW API compatibility with MCP before finalizing notes.
- Call out user-impacting changes (bindings, CVars, settings migration).
- Confirm `CombatMode/CombatMode.toc` `## Version` matches the new Keep a Changelog section in `CombatMode/CHANGELOG.md`.
- After editing `CHANGELOG.md`, run `pwsh ./scripts/sync-changelog-to-lua.ps1`.
- Full lint gate: `pre-commit run --all-files`.

Day-to-day code finishes use `combatmode-change-checklist.mdc` (lint, then ask before TOC/changelog/sync).
